        "σ C2-O4 -> π O4-C11",
        "π C11-N12 -> lp N12"
      ],
      "explanationAfterStep": "Dicyclohexylurea leaves, neutral, and the OBt active ester remains. Forming the strong urea C=O pays for the activation."
    },
